  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 315.01 Definition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 315.01 Definition. For purposes of this part, “public agency” means a federal or state agency or a municipal public works department that is responsible for maintaining public infrastructure.\n\nSource. #12803, eff 12-15-19",
